        },
        {
          "text": "“Kïlenyona ntökïlenchokwa chi, ‘Anyi Kristo,’* anta lö, ‘Anyinö mi otinö!’ Maghan ngalechi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ompöwölo relu Kristotino putintön nko werkoyi putintön. Poru chane tïkwïn cho pö töngönchin cho lïso pich, lïsöy ompö chini le kïlan pö Tororöt ato muko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orip kegh! Kanyaghan omwowokwa ngal löwïr kïtö kïlowöch.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
